      "height": 196,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "1. Database + models + migrations\n2. Password hashing + JWT service + refresh token persistence\n3. Login/logout UI + token validation + refresh flow\n4. RBAC helpers + permission checks on repo actions\n5. Repository ownership + repository_access + filtered dropdown\n6. Admin views + audit logs\n7. Hardening: token rotation, revocation strategy, brute-force protection",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Database + models + migrations\n2. Password hashing + JWT service + refresh token persistence\n3. Login/logout UI + token validation + refresh flow\n4. RBAC helpers + permission checks on repo actions\n5. Repository ownership + repository_access + filtered dropdown\n6. Admin views + audit logs\n7. Hardening: token rotation, revocation strategy, brute-force protection",
